"B<int euidaccess(const char *>I<pathname>B<, int >I<mode>B<);>\n"
"B<int eaccess(const char *>I<pathname>B<, int >I<mode>B<);>\n"
msgstr ""
"B<int euidaccess(const char *>I<pathname>B<, int >I<mode>B<);>\n"
